      "description": "The BPMN and DMN this layer OWNS: the paper's content processes, grouped by concern exactly as the harness groups its own (`processes/<group>/`, a DMN in `processes/<group>/decisions/`). `content/authoring-a-paper.bpmn` with `content/decisions/lean-build-gate.dmn`, `content/atomic-mass-drift-check.bpmn` and `content/lean-docs-publish.bpmn`. They name Lean and paper skills that live here, which cat-harness cannot reach. Their calls and skill refs that stay generic point DOWN through core to the harness.",
